Welcome to DreamStudio Manual Support!

DSMAN (.dsman) is a notebook collection of manual files that comes shipped with
DreamStudio's standard installation. You can access files and read documentations
easily using DreamStudio Terminal for Documentations. 

Getting Started:
To search any topic, you have several options: 
1. Type-in the name of the topic you would like to search for.
2. Type-in the name of the command you are looking for, any type of DreamStudio's 
   commands would work whether inside this terminal or in other DreamStudio's 
   terminals.
3. You can also extend your search by looking inside manual files, not just only
   by file's name, that is by typing the command: 

   >>> Search-Topic {topic-word} {search-time} {looking-in}

   {topic-word}: The word you are searching for.
   {topic-time}: How much time the engine would take at maximum to search
                 (default is one minute)
   {looking-in}: whether to look in a specific location or not. Default is false.
                 (if true, the engine would extend its searching capabilities for
                 better results).

Further Documentation:
If you like PDF-Style documentations, you could read the PDF documentation manual
associated with the version you installed. 

